# RoboticelaOS runtime plan

Phase + goal number + short name. Each phase ends with a **wire/integrate** goal against all completed phases.
Completed stack today: **Phases 0-12**, **Phase 15** and **Phase 16** (RoboJS module + host suites; no guest half). Phase 13/14 consumer seams (Input, DesktopBridge) remain open.

## Cross-stack integration (completed phases)

- **X.1** Wire and integrate Phases 0-15 with each other ✅ (Base->Mem->Containers->Unicode/I18N->Font->Text->Graphics->Display->Window->HTML->CSS->Layout->Paint->Render->Desktop->Compositor; Input consumer seam still open — see X.2)
- **X.2** Close remaining consumer seams among completed phases (DesktopBridge/`data-command`; Input→Window/Document focus delivery refinements) — Input→Desktop and Compositor→Desktop present closed; RoboJS→Desktop page script closed in 16.16 (`RoboDesktopScript`)

